1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,320
Disclaimer: The characters, behaviors, locations, organizations, professions, and events depicted in this series

2
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,520
are entirely fictional and created solely for entertainment purposes.

3
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,800
This series is not intended to guide, influence, or encourage any actions portrayed herein.

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,040
Viewer discretion is advised.

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,160
I'm breaking up with you.

6
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,200
Bua, no.

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:13,920
I'm not breaking up with you.

8
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,120
Zip it up a bit.

9
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,360
We have sweat glands. Humans have sweat glands.

10
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,440
I'm not his boyfriend,

11
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,160
no matter how badly he wants me.

12
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,200
The breakup...

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,200
was it because of me?

14
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:11,240
When you asked if we broke up because of you...

15
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:14,960
How did you even know?

16
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:19,160
Well, Dad, you said it yourself back then that...

17
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:24,920
Ever since you opened the shop, you haven't seen anyone besides customers.

18
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,000
And as for Daddy Bua...

19
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,400
Ever since he quit being an actor, he's spent all his time with me.

20
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:32,479
He didn't see any friends, didn't go anywhere.

21
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,240
If you were gonna break up over anyone,

22
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,560
it's gotta be because of me, right?

23
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,240
It couldn't be because of the customers.

24
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:58,000
I really didn't want you thinking it was because of you.

25
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:03,080
Honestly, it was because...

26
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:05,480
It was because of me.

27
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:15,880
I loved you so much,

28
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:20,320
and I wanted to be with you all the time,

29
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:28,960
to the point where I didn't have time or attention left for Daddy Baa.

30
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:41,440
Daddy Baa had his worries, he felt left out sometimes...

31
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:44,440
just like a clingy little puppy.

32
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:52,040
At first, it probably sounded ridiculous, right?

33
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:54,520
A dad being jealous of his own kid.

34
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:59,880
But when I really thought about it, son...

35
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,960
it was on me.

36
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:06,960
I really did change.

37
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:13,520
I just didn't have romantic feelings for Daddy Baa anymore.

38
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:25,560
I'm so sorry, son.

39
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:28,800
I love you so much.

40
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,800
I didn't want to tell you because I didn't want you feeling bad.

41
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:39,440
It really wasn't because of you.

42
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:48,480
I understand. It's okay. I love you too, muah.

43
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:51,360
Don't overthink it, Dad.

44
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,720
And what about you?

45
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:59,040
Moving over there,

46
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,000
trying out breaking up,

47
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,440
giving each other space...

48
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:05,440
did it make things better?

49
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:48,280
You still kept the memory card?

50
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:51,280
Can I see it?

51
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:42,720
I feel guilty

52
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:53,440
for not keeping the photos you took for me.

53
00:05:58,200 --> 00:06:01,200
I'm sorry.

54
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:51,440
I tried, I really did.

55
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:55,640
Just like what I told our kid.

56
00:06:57,040 --> 00:07:00,040
Even after going to the States and coming back...

57
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:05,600
the feeling is still the same.

58
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:18,520
But...

59
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:26,760
I still want you in my life as a friend.

60
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,640
I only ask for one thing.

61
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:40,840
Please don't go anywhere.

62
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:49,560
Even if it's just as friends,

63
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:56,880
stay and help take care of Baby first, okay?

64
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:55,120
He's striking more poses than his dad now.

65
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,800
Don't gas him up too much, or it'll go straight to his head.

66
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:59,800
Way too handsome!

67
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,920
A bit more, just a little more.

68
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:07,080
Switch poses, switch it up!

69
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,360
Still not enough, Dad?

70
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,840
Let's get everything on the table.

71
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,120
Anything left?

72
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,080
All out.

73
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:15,080
Yeah, nothing left now.

74
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:21,600
Come on, we're ready.

75
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,480
Alright.

76
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,120
Daddy Chian, Daddy Bua, this camera, okay?

77
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:27,120
3, 2, 1, let's go!

78
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:30,320
Yes, yes! Slay!

79
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:32,840
More, more, more!

80
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:35,640
Fabulous, c'mon now.

81
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:36,880
More!

82
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:38,320
That's enough, I'm embarrassed now.

83
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:41,760
I'm embarrassed. Let me see. Is it cute?

84
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,600
Yes, it is.

85
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,560
Yeah, just like old times, right?

86
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,080
Totally.

87
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,320
Yeah.

88
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,360
Slay!

89
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:50,120
Oh, hey Baa, Fou4Mod!

90
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,480
Hey, come check this out, hurry!

91
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,920
What are you guys doing?

92
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:55,480
The dance from just now, come take a look.

93
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,280
Does it look like old times?

94
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:58,720
Whoa, still nailed it.

95
00:11:58,720 --> 00:11:59,520
Just like when you were kids.

96
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:00,640
Cute, right?

97
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,000
Is it okay?

98
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,760
Well...it looks nice and aged.

99
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,840
Hey, watch your mouth.

100
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:08,840
Watch your mouth, watch your mouth!

101
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:13,800
Alright, let's go.

102
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:14,520
Let's head inside already.

103
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:15,080
I was giving you a compliment.

104
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,680
Let's go, let's go.

105
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:19,680
Come on, sweetie.

106
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:42,840
Thank you so much to all the guests who came today.

107
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,960
Thank you to our families,

108
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:47,320
thank you to our friends from Yurawit,

109
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:49,440
our friends from Accounting,

110
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:51,560
fellow SUGAR,

111
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:54,560
and everyone in the SUGAR family.

112
00:12:56,400 --> 00:13:00,680
And thank you very much to P Four and your family

113
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:03,680
for coming to our wedding today.

114
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:08,000
You are the reason the two of us met.

115
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:18,840
Today is the absolute best day of my life as a fangirl.

116
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,480
I never would have thought

117
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:23,480
that you'd actually come to a fan's wedding.

118
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:29,160
You're still the same lovely person you've always been.

119
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:33,160
You hit the gym and stay fit and healthy

120
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:36,400
just so you can stay with your fans for a long time.

121
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:39,760
Plus, you're covered in tattoos now...

122
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:42,680
which is insanely attractive!

123
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:44,240
So cute...

124
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:47,240
You were our first love.

125
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:56,120
Because we loved P Four,

126
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:59,320
we were able to find each other.

127
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:01,480
It took us a really long time

128
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:05,920
to love each other as much as we love you.

129
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:08,080
And today has finally come,

130
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:15,000
the day our wings grew strong enough to fall in love with each other.

131
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:18,440
This is the only time in my life my heart has ever wandered.

132
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:22,320
Even so, we practiced loving you with all our hearts,

133
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:25,320
which is why we know how to love each other so well.

134
00:14:28,160 --> 00:14:32,440
It's crazy, declaring love for my idol at my own wedding.

135
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:47,800
And I also want to thank Chian.

136
00:14:57,320 --> 00:15:00,320
You're our idol when it comes to love.

137
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:07,360
Who knows how long you two had to keep it a secret,

138
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:12,360
how tightly you had to hold each other's hands,

139
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:17,120
before getting to a day where you have such an adorable kid.

140
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:27,040
The two of you made us feel like...

141
00:15:27,040 --> 00:15:30,040
we want to stan our own partner

142
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:38,520
just as much as we stan our idol.

143
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:45,360
I wish P Four and Chian a long and lasting love,

144
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:51,160
and that you'll never have to part ways ever again.

145
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:56,240
We're definitely following in your footsteps.

146
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,560
Do our whole family really have to move to America?

147
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:09,600
Can I not go?

148
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:11,920
I don't have any friends over there.

149
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:15,640
I already told you I'm not going anymore.

150
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:19,800
Is this a gift?

151
00:16:19,800 --> 00:16:22,080
Yeah.

152
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:22,880
Thank you.

153
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,040
Chian.

154
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:35,040
Yeah?

155
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:38,040
I'll stay with our son.

156
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:40,480
You should go.

157
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:43,280
I mean, if I go this time,

158
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:46,880
I have to oversee the hotel construction, which probably takes...

159
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:50,040
like seven to eight years.

160
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:53,640
That's a no.

161
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:57,080
I'd rather be here.

162
00:16:57,080 --> 00:17:00,080
Working here means I get to stay with our son too.

163
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:17,000
But Chian, you've always supported me,

164
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:20,760
almost all my life.

165
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:25,040
Let me support you for once.

166
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:28,040
Go follow your dream.

167
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:32,800
I can stay with our boy.

168
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:35,360
And during school breaks,

169
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:42,280
we can always fly over to see you.

170
00:17:55,480 --> 00:18:01,240
So this means we have to part again?

171
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:46,160
Gelz.

172
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:52,920
Yo!

173
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:04,400
I'll be up here, so down you go.

174
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:22,680
About your dad moving to the States...

175
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,920
If you need any help, just let me know.

176
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,800
Yeah.

177
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:28,520
Same goes for you.

178
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:34,400
If there's anything you need help with, you can tell me too.

179
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:39,680
I really wanted your dads to get back together, you know.

180
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:43,800
That day...

181
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:46,800
I'm sorry I didn't finish the story.

182
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:50,960
I just didn't want you to get hurt.

183
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:53,960
I'm really sorry.

184
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:06,680
Right.

185
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:08,240
Then finish the story.

186
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:11,320
Tell me how your dads and mine made up in the end.

187
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:14,320
Call it your redemption.

188
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:18,520
Yeah, deal.

189
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:40,480
Though once I finish telling it...

190
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:43,480
will you be my boyfriend?

191
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:18,280
Fine, I'll just tell it.

192
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:32,880
I'd like it made into a flower bouquet, please.

193
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:36,280
Is this for the Fou4Mod fan meeting?

194
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:43,280
Yes, it is.

195
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:46,760
You can make it a really big one.

196
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:50,000
Look, I recognize you from X.

197
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:52,640
I don't support harassing the artist.

198
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:56,440
Please take your business to another shop.

199
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:59,480
Calm down, I'm not actually going to the event myself.

200
00:21:59,480 --> 00:22:02,640
I'm just having it delivered to him, asking a friend to bring it.

201
00:22:02,640 --> 00:22:05,400
I'm not doing it. Please go find another shop.

202
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,640
I've got Fou4Mod giveaways to hand out!

203
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:34,800
Anyone interested?

204
00:22:34,800 --> 00:22:39,920
Tons of them, starting right from his very first event.

205
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:41,960
Here you go. Hey, please keep rooting for our boy.

206
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,560
Don't disappear, okay? Keep supporting him.

207
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:45,080
May our fandom grow huge.

208
00:22:45,080 --> 00:22:47,200
All right, thank you so much.

209
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:49,760
Anyone who hasn't gotten one can still come grab some.

210
00:22:57,720 --> 00:23:00,320
Where are you? A certain celebrity wants to see you.

211
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:01,840
Meet me in front of the staff room, okay?

212
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,920
Is something up?

213
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:15,920
Nothing, I just wanted to see you.

214
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:21,680
Here.

215
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:31,880
Is this for me?

216
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:40,920
Come find me after the show's over, okay? Let's take some photos.

217
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:51,600
Sure.

218
00:23:53,800 --> 00:23:56,760
Hey, I made tons of giveaways myself, you know.

219
00:23:56,760 --> 00:23:58,240
Got everything right here,

220
00:23:58,240 --> 00:24:01,240
hair clips, stickers, all of it.

221
00:24:05,120 --> 00:24:08,120
Wanna take some? You could wear them during the show.

222
00:24:14,040 --> 00:24:16,480
Just give them to me after the event.

223
00:24:16,480 --> 00:24:19,480
I'll keep them for you.

224
00:24:24,200 --> 00:24:27,200
And didn't you make any giveaways for Bua?

225
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:33,440
No.

226
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:36,440
Better stick to solo stan, I'm not really feeling the ex-boyfriend dynamic.

227
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:52,240
Baa.

228
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:56,680
There's something I need to tell you.

229
00:24:57,560 --> 00:25:00,560
What is it?

230
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:04,880
That whole ship thing with Bua...

231
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:09,000
Sure, it started with him,

232
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:13,880
but he didn't do it because he wanted clout.

233
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:22,720
And he didn't even do it to help me out.

234
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:29,480
He did it because of you.

235
00:25:35,400 --> 00:25:38,400
Bua!

236
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:39,960
I love you so damn much, you know that?

237
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:42,960
Where did I fall short taking care of you?

238
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:06,040
Where are you going? Your mom went back to Khon Kaen already...

239
00:30:17,320 --> 00:30:18,880
15 comments

240
00:30:18,880 --> 00:30:20,320
My brain is rotting...

241
00:30:20,320 --> 00:30:22,000
Auntie here is kicking her feet!

242
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,360
I'm not gonna lie, the chemistry is there!

243
00:30:23,360 --> 00:30:26,360
Don't mess with my feelings!

244
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:37,440
Bua: Hey...

245
00:30:43,840 --> 00:30:46,840
Fou4Mod: Yeah?

246
00:30:46,840 --> 00:30:48,840
I don't know how to do this.

247
00:30:48,840 --> 00:30:51,840
Just fan service, normal stuff.

248
00:30:56,480 --> 00:31:00,800
Alright, I'll just follow along.

249
00:31:08,280 --> 00:31:10,720
I hid all the clips and photos of Baa on my socials,

250
00:31:10,720 --> 00:31:13,720
ready to post our ship photos now.

251
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:17,920
Then you go leave a comment, anything will do.

252
00:31:20,280 --> 00:31:23,280
What about Baa?

253
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:40,240
I want him to see

254
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:43,240
that your very first fan meet sold out.

255
00:31:46,240 --> 00:31:49,240
His whole happiness is stanning you.

256
00:31:52,080 --> 00:31:55,080
Are you okay?

257
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:11,880
Honestly, he even told me not to tell you,

258
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:17,640
because he knew that if you found out, you'd never let him do it, right?

259
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:27,960
Well, good thing I've got a big mouth.

260
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:30,960
Already blabbed...

261
00:32:36,840 --> 00:32:41,800
So you...

262
00:32:42,080 --> 00:32:44,240
go easy on him, okay?

263
00:32:52,600 --> 00:32:53,840
Alright, man.

264
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:56,720
Go get your makeup done.

265
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,760
Alright.

266
00:33:01,360 --> 00:33:02,400
Bye.

267
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,600
See ya.

268
00:33:03,600 --> 00:33:04,840
Don't forget to scream for me.

269
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:07,600
I'll scream right away.

270
00:33:07,600 --> 00:33:08,480
Make sure I can hear you.

271
00:33:08,480 --> 00:33:10,320
Fou4Mod!

