I'm your boyfriend now, aren't I?

542
01:10:43,960 --> 01:10:45,320
I'm a celebrity's boyfriend.

543
01:10:46,480 --> 01:10:49,480
Let's see it then.

544
01:11:24,160 --> 01:11:27,000
Gelz, look at the camera.

545
01:11:27,000 --> 01:11:30,000
Gelz, you look so handsome.

546
01:11:42,560 --> 01:11:44,680
Sign this for me, will you?

547
01:11:44,680 --> 01:11:47,680
Me?

548
01:11:47,680 --> 01:11:50,680
Well, who else would it be?

549
01:11:52,000 --> 01:11:55,000
Open it.

550
01:12:37,720 --> 01:12:41,160
When did you even take this?

551
01:12:41,160 --> 01:12:43,680
When do you ever see me not taking it?

552
01:12:43,680 --> 01:12:45,880
Snap, flash!

553
01:12:45,880 --> 01:12:48,800
Slay, bang, raise that camera...

554
01:12:48,800 --> 01:12:51,800
I'm literally your CCTV.

555
01:12:55,160 --> 01:12:57,040
Look,

556
01:12:57,040 --> 01:12:59,320
I'll just confess.

557
01:12:59,320 --> 01:13:02,320
The truth is, I never stanned anyone that hard.

558
01:13:03,720 --> 01:13:06,720
I only stanned because of you.

559
01:13:12,480 --> 01:13:15,480
Because I'm your stan.

560
01:13:17,960 --> 01:13:20,600
You stan me?

561
01:13:20,600 --> 01:13:22,120
For real?

562
01:13:24,480 --> 01:13:29,840
Listen, I think I fell for you precisely because you're a stan.

563
01:13:34,760 --> 01:13:36,080
Look at those eyes.

564
01:13:36,080 --> 01:13:37,200
Whenever you stan someone...

565
01:13:37,200 --> 01:13:38,360
it's like...

566
01:13:38,360 --> 01:13:39,880
so playful...

567
01:13:39,880 --> 01:13:42,120
like a tiny little puppy.

568
01:13:42,120 --> 01:13:45,720
It's adorable.

569
01:13:45,720 --> 01:13:48,720
It's exceeding the cuteness quota again, right?

570
01:13:57,280 --> 01:14:01,240
But now that you're done stanning, I just feel like

571
01:14:01,240 --> 01:14:07,000
this book has fully served its purpose.

572
01:14:07,000 --> 01:14:10,000
So I want you

573
01:14:14,960 --> 01:14:17,960
to sign it for me.

574
01:14:18,480 --> 01:14:21,480
Of course.

575
01:14:26,080 --> 01:14:29,080
Hello, what is your name?

576
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:35,000
It's Buaban.

577
01:14:38,440 --> 01:14:41,440
All set, Buaban!

578
01:14:43,880 --> 01:14:49,640
Congrats, you chose the right person. By: Tiny little puppy.

579
01:15:01,480 --> 01:15:04,480
Hey, this reminds me of when we used to stan people together.

580
01:15:44,600 --> 01:15:46,160
Gelz...

581
01:15:46,160 --> 01:15:48,320
Daddy Bua said his heart was racing.

582
01:15:48,320 --> 01:15:50,960
They're back in love again.

583
01:15:50,960 --> 01:15:53,960
Hey, Babe, I'm so happy for you.

584
01:15:54,480 --> 01:15:55,520
Gelz...

585
01:15:55,520 --> 01:15:57,680
I have something to tell you.

586
01:15:57,680 --> 01:16:00,680
Come with me for a sec.

587
01:16:04,920 --> 01:16:07,920
Where are we going?

588
01:16:46,320 --> 01:16:49,320
Babe...

589
01:16:53,120 --> 01:16:54,600
Can we forget about that promise...

590
01:16:54,600 --> 01:16:57,600
the one about getting our nails done together every month?

591
01:16:59,600 --> 01:17:02,120
I'm scared of my nails falling off...

592
01:17:13,520 --> 01:17:16,520
The thing is...

593
01:17:18,120 --> 01:17:21,120
I'm going to the States with my daddies.

594
01:17:22,680 --> 01:17:25,680
I don't want them to be apart anymore.

595
01:17:52,000 --> 01:17:55,000
I think you're making the right choice.

596
01:17:59,800 --> 01:18:02,800
Thank you.

597
01:18:15,440 --> 01:18:18,440
It's okay, I understand.

598
01:19:01,640 --> 01:19:04,040
C'mon, let's take some photos.

599
01:19:04,040 --> 01:19:05,880
Let's show off the nails too.

600
01:19:05,880 --> 01:19:08,880
One, two, three.

601
01:19:09,440 --> 01:19:10,680
One more...

602
01:19:10,680 --> 01:19:13,680
One, two, three.

603
01:19:17,440 --> 01:19:20,440
Stick your tongues out too.

604
01:19:28,120 --> 01:19:31,120
Gelboys!

605
01:19:35,640 --> 01:19:38,640
Let's swap these so you'll miss me.

606
01:19:47,720 --> 01:19:49,440
Here.

607
01:19:59,960 --> 01:20:02,960
So shall we go?

608
01:20:04,520 --> 01:20:06,760
See ya, Baa.

609
01:20:06,760 --> 01:20:09,760
See ya.

610
01:20:22,200 --> 01:20:24,160
See you around.

611
01:20:24,160 --> 01:20:27,160
Gelboy.

612
01:20:39,840 --> 01:20:42,840
See ya.

613
01:21:08,400 --> 01:21:11,400
Will you be my boyfriend?

614
01:21:31,040 --> 01:21:34,040
Will you be my boyfriend?
